The Validation Pipeline
The validate_message() function runs all three checks in a specific order: HMAC first, then timestamp, then sequence. The order is not arbitrary.

If any check fails, the function returns immediately with False and the results so far. The subscriber does not need to know why the other checks would have passed or failed — one failure is enough to reject.
 
